    "title": "Meet Ohio's 2026 out LGBTQ+ candidates for public office - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By H.L. Comeriato ,\n21 hours ago As part of our “Out at the Polls” voting series, we’ve compiled a list of out LGBTQ+ candidates running for public office across the state. Ohio Pride PAC has endorsed every out LGBTQ+ candidate but one – Arienne Childrey, who cannot be endorsed by the PAC while serving as a current member of its board of directors. Read full article\n6",
